                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Asmitha Karunanithi",
                        "email": "asmitk01@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "asmithakarun"
                    },
                    "message": "Can these be taken into a separate helper method like below:\n```\n    void setSockAddrIn(struct sockaddr* sa, const struct in_addr& addr)\n    {\n        auto* sin = reinterpret_cast<struct sockaddr_in*>(sa);\n        sin->sin_family = AF_INET;\n        sin->sin_addr = addr;\n    }\n```\n\nAnd the helper method can be called like:\n```\nsetSockAddrIn(&ifr.ifr_addr, addr);\n..\nsetSockAddrIn(&ifr.ifr_netmask, netmask);\n..\nsetSockAddrIn(&ifr.ifr_broadaddr, bcast);\n```"
                },
